288 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 218 0 R/E(AIESEC in Rwanda term 23.24, our journey unfolded with a dedicated focus on youth development, community impact, and strategic partnerships. Guided by a commitment to our organisational ethos, this report encapsulates the essence of our endeavours from August to July 2024.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

289 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 218 0 R/E(AIESEC in Rwanda remains steadfast in its mission to empower communities and foster youth development. With 15+ years of impactful presence in Rwanda, our partnerships with private and public institutions reflect a shared commitment to community growth. Through various programs, we have contributed to Rwanda's development and celebrated our 15th+ Anniversary, rekindling memories of vivid leadership and a lasting impact.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

290 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 218 0 R/E(Addressing challenges head-on, our operations focused on refining the Global Volunteer program, placing a strategic emphasis on Incoming Global Volunteers. Organisational Development initiatives ensured growth, education, and expansion, with a spotlight on accountability systems and learning opportunities.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

291 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 218 0 R/E(The events highlights of the year like the Board of Presidents Summits, Executive Board Summit, the 15th+ Anniversary Celebration, Global Monew Week, Key Competence for practice workshop, the Dynamite Conference and Youth to Business Forum showcased our dedication to synergy, collaboration, and transformative experiences. New partnerships, renewed partnerships and in-kind collaborations further expanded our network and resources.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

292 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 218 0 R/E(Challenges in partnership timelines and stakeholder engagement underscored the need for enhanced training and clarity of purpose. Despite hurdles, our adaptability and commitment to positive change shone through, positioning us for continued growth.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

293 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 218 0 R/E(As we conclude, we reflect on our achievements, lessons learned, and the road travelled. With gratitude for the shared commitment of AIESECers, partners, and stakeholders, we embarked on this journey with renewed vigour. Together, we shaped leaders, foster collaboration, and leaft an enduring impact on the landscape of impact and empowerment in Rwanda.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

