354 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 223 0 R/E(In AIESEC, where turnover is a significant challenge, talent management becomes a linchpin for organisational success. Unlike traditional Human Resources \(HR\), Talent Management \(TM\) transcends administrative aspects like payrolls and benefits. While HR handles technicalities, TM adopts a strategic approach, prioritising the identification, support, and development of top talents. It goes beyond routine HR functions, aiming to propel individuals to their peak potential. As we grapple with high turnover rates, effective Talent Management emerges as a crucial driver, ensuring the sustained vibrancy and impact of AIESEC by fostering a culture of continuous learning and strategic leadership development.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

