358 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 224 0 R/T(Transitioning from the 2022.2023 terms, where our emphasis was on membership development due to its integral role in our organisational value proposition, the 2023.2024 term marks a strategic shift. In this term, we recognise the significance of enhancing physical touchpoints, mainly through conferences and functional summits. While membership development remains pivotal, we believe that augmenting in-person interactions can amplify the impact of our initiatives. )/E(Transitioning from the 2022.2023 terms, where our emphasis was on membership development due to its integral role in our organisational value proposition, the 2023.2024 term marks a strategic shift. In this term, we recognise the significance of enhancing physical touchpoints, mainly through conferences and functional summits. While membership development remains pivotal, we believe that augmenting in-person interactions can amplify the impact of our initiatives. )/Pg 19 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

359 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 224 0 R/T(By concentrating on physical touchpoints, we created richer, more immersive experiences that strengthen connections, foster collaboration, and deepen the human aspect of our organisation. This strategic pivot aligns with our commitment to continuous improvement and ensuring that every facet of AIESEC in the 2023.2024 term reflects our dedication to meaningful, personal engagements.)/E(By concentrating on physical touchpoints, we created richer, more immersive experiences that strengthen connections, foster collaboration, and deepen the human aspect of our organisation. This strategic pivot aligns with our commitment to continuous improvement and ensuring that every facet of AIESEC in the 2023.2024 term reflects our dedication to meaningful, personal engagements.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[1]>>
