endobj

458 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 231 0 R/T(The summit serves as a platform for transparent communication, shared vision, and collaborative decision-making, aiming to ensure that the strategic direction, plans, and goals of AIESEC in Rwanda are well-aligned and optimised to empower young leaders and drive positive change at national and local levels.)/E(The summit serves as a platform for transparent communication, shared vision, and collaborative decision-making, aiming to ensure that the strategic direction, plans, and goals of AIESEC in Rwanda are well-aligned and optimised to empower young leaders and drive positive change at national and local levels.)/Pg 26 0 R/K[4]>>
