463 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 232 0 R/T(AIESEC in Rwanda 15th+ Anniversary)/E(AIESEC in Rwanda 15th+ Anniversary)/Pg 27 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

464 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 232 0 R/E(In 2023, AIESEC  celebrated 75 years of existence globally. AIESEC in Rwanda celebrated 15+ years of Vivid Leadership and its impact on Rwandan society. This celebration recreated vivid memories and experiences that are so impactful and memorable and that produce potent feelings and solid and clear images in our minds. The celebration was mainly focused on the impact of experiences and vivid AIESEC stories, connections, and memories through the decades.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

465 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 232 0 R/E(The theme highlights AIESEC's global impact over the past 75 years, as well as AIESEC in Rwanda's countrywide and beyond impact over the past 15+ years. It acknowledges the legacy of bold and VIVID leadership that AIESEC has developed over the years and celebrates the organisation's ongoing commitment to developing leaders who can make a positive impact in their communities and around the world.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

466 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 232 0 R/E(The Anniversary Celebration was held on 25 November 2023 to commemorate 15+ years of AIESEC in Rwanda.  The event brought together a diverse group of delegates, Past and current partners of AIESEC in Rwanda, Co-founders of AIESEC in Rwanda, Board of Advisors for AIESEC in Rwanda, Country Presidents since the inception of AIESEC in Rwanda, AIESEC in Rwanda\220s alummni community and Current AIESEC in Rwanda members and friends.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

