533 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 237 0 R/T(Dynamite conference The "Dynamite" yearly national conference is a dynamic and empowering event organised by AIESEC in Rwanda. It is designed to provide participants with a transformative experience that enhances leadership skills, personal growth, and self-confidence. Through a series of interactive workshops, seminars, and keynote speeches, the conference aims to empower young leaders to become impactful change-makers within AIESEC and beyond. The theme of the Dynamite Conference 2024 was \217\217Advocating Cultural Diversity in Solving Tomorrow\220s Skills Miss Match\216\220\220 chaired by Mr. Joseph Olupot alumni from Uganda. It was the first national conference after covid held from 2nd to 5th May 2024 the last national conference was in 2018 before covid-19. )/E(Dynamite conference The "Dynamite" yearly national conference is a dynamic and empowering event organised by AIESEC in Rwanda. It is designed to provide participants with a transformative experience that enhances leadership skills, personal growth, and self-confidence. Through a series of interactive workshops, seminars, and keynote speeches, the conference aims to empower young leaders to become impactful change-makers within AIESEC and beyond. The theme of the Dynamite Conference 2024 was \217\217Advocating Cultural Diversity in Solving Tomorrow\220s Skills Miss Match\216\220\220 chaired by Mr. Joseph Olupot alumni from Uganda. It was the first national conference after covid held from 2nd to 5th May 2024 the last national conference was in 2018 before covid-19. )/Pg 32 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

