<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 243 0 R/T(Expenditure: The overall level of expenditure increased in order to manage the increase in operations. This was largely due to the increase in human resources, investment and hosting of regional conferences.)/E(Expenditure: The overall level of expenditure increased in order to manage the increase in operations. This was largely due to the increase in human resources, investment and hosting of regional conferences.)/Pg 38 0 R/K[3]>>
