626 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 245 0 R/E(As we draw the curtain on this term of AIESEC in Rwanda, the pages of our journey reflect resilience, collaboration, and impactful strides. Our commitment to community and youth development, manifested through diverse programs and strong partnerships, underscores the tangible change we aspire to bring to Rwanda. This semester's accomplishments are a testament to our members' dedication and our partners' unwavering support. As we celebrate the milestones achieved, we also acknowledge the lessons learned and areas for growth. With renewed enthusiasm and a shared commitment, we look ahead to the next team with confident that the seeds of positive change planted today will blossom into a brighter future for the communities we serve. Together, let us continue shaping leaders, fostering collaboration, and leaving an indelible mark on the landscape of impact and empowerment in Rwanda.)/Pg 40 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

