<</Title(Transitioning from the 2022.2023 terms, where our emphasis was on membership development due to its integral role in our organisational value proposition, the 2023.2024 term marks a strategic shift. In this term, we recognise the significance of enhancing physical touchpoints, mainly through conferences and functional summits. While membership development remains pivotal, we believe that augmenting in-person interactions can amplify the impact of our initiatives.)/Dest[19 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 1335 0 R/Next 1349 0 R>>
endobj

